<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mast renews earlier cautionary on talks.</title>
<headline>Mast renews earlier cautionary on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mast Holdings Ltd on Thursday renewed a cautionary published on May 13, saying that the talks unspecified talks referred to therein were still in progress.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
